Comment: The binaries also contain third-party Rust crates. Release
 packages built by Dockerfile.release list them, with their licenses, in
 /usr/share/doc/gpudog/THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES. For a package built from
 source, run "python3 scripts/third-party-licenses.py --output
 THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES" in the source tree.

